{"id":"defaults-every-parameter-powers-up-where-its-page-says","path":"inferences/roland-sc8850-01/defaults-every-parameter-powers-up-where-its-page-says.json","unitId":"roland-sc8850-01","state":"standing","level":"investigating","why":"no model has been rendered and compared with the unit","verdict":null,"rounds":1,"madeAt":"2026-09-16T04:00:25+00:00","madeBy":"backup/does-the-unit-power-up-where-its-manual-says.py, backup/write-the-defaults-inference.py","about":{"scope":"unit","class":null,"types":[],"addresses":["40 03 03","40 03 16"],"checkedOnUnits":[]},"title":null,"printedTypes":[],"supersededBy":null,"retractedBecause":null,"claim":"Every effect parameter this unit powers up holding is a value its own manual prints as that parameter's default. 575 parameters across sixty-five types were in a position to disagree and none did, 154 of them at a byte the printing leaves no choice about.","named":null,"whyNotNamed":"There is nothing here to name. The claim is that a table in the part and a table on a page hold the same numbers, and a name would suggest a mechanism where what is being reported is an agreement.","adds":"Each record says what one address of one type held at power on, and each says in as many words that the printed range beside it is evidence about a page rather than about the unit. The page says what a parameter's default is, in the parameter's own units, and does not say which byte that is. Neither says the two agree, and turning one into the other needs a third table -- the conversion grid, for every parameter whose byte does not carry its setting. This file is where the three are joined.","refutedBy":"One parameter powering up on a byte its page prints no default at, where the page marks a default and the conversion pins it to a single byte. Those are where this claim is at risk; the rest sit inside a run of bytes the page prints one setting across, and could have agreed by landing anywhere in it.","couldHaveBeenRefutedBy":"The comparison ran over every parameter of every type the list prints and the records hold, not over a chosen few. It was written to report disagreements and it reported four on its first run -- all four its own, from taking the first byte printing a setting where the page prints that setting at several.","whatItWouldChange":"The held-tone survey writes one type and nothing else, so every other parameter of that type is at its default and the readings are of a type in a state the archive could describe only as `whatever the unit powers up holding`. It can now be named, parameter by parameter, in the units the parameter is set in -- which is what an excursion measured off that take has to be interpreted against.","grounds":{"measurements":[{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-20-parked.json","within":"efx-params/01-20-parked.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 03].default","parameters[address=40 03 04].default"],"values":[36,16]},{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-20.json","within":"efx-params/01-20.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 03].default","parameters[address=40 03 04].default"],"values":[36,16]},{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-21-parked.json","within":"efx-params/01-21-parked.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 07].default"],"values":[40]},{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-21.json","within":"efx-params/01-21.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 07].default"],"values":[40]},{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-22.json","within":"efx-params/01-22.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 03].default","parameters[address=40 03 04].default"],"values":[6,113]},{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-23.json","within":"efx-params/01-23.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 05].default","parameters[address=40 03 06].default"],"values":[16,11]},{"file":"data/units/roland-sc8850-01/efx-params/01-24.json","within":"efx-params/01-24.json","keys":["parameters[address=40 03 03].default